hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"19222","Abu Ahmad al-Zubayri narrated to us, Kathir ibn Zayd narrated to us from al-Muttalib ibn Abdullah from Itban or Ibn Itban al-Ansari who said: I said: O Prophet of Allah, I was with my wife, and when I heard your voice I withdrew and washed. The Messenger of Allah (peace and blessings of Allah be upon him) said: Water is from water."
